c. But above all, he is impeccably groomed. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-transform: none; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \"inherit\", serif; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;\"><o:p> </o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-transform: none; line-height: 16.8pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: \"inherit\", serif; letter-spacing: -0.25pt;\">A rascal isn’t afraid to be true to himself. He is unconfined by the social norms of polite society, and he is too busy standing out to be concerned with fitting in. At RASCAL, we give men the tools they need to be who they’ve always wanted to be: their authentic selves. We empower men to drop all pretenses and live out loud. Our goal — our truest purpose — is to liberate the rascal within us all. The time is now. Come free yourself.<o:p></o:p></span></p></h2></div></div>",
